{"seq":2,"slug":"social-epistemology","title":"社会认识论与意见分歧：该不该向别人让步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/practice/social-epistemology","wordCount":1693,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"社会认识论与意见分歧-该不该向别人让步\">社会认识论与意见分歧：该不该向别人让步</h1><p>知识很少是一个人闭门造出来的：我们信任证言、依赖专家、在争论中修正立场。当一个你认为同样理性、同样知情的人——一个认识论意义上的「同侪」——与你意见相左，你该怎么办？向他靠拢，还是坚持己见？这个「同侪分歧」问题是社会认识论形式化程度最高的入口。它直接承接<a href=\"../dynamics/common-knowledge\">共同知识一篇</a>的奥曼定理，把「理性主体能否同意地不同意」从定理推向可操作的规范之争，再延伸到多人意见如何聚合的一般问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-认识同侪与两种极端立场\">核心概念：认识同侪与两种极端立场</h2><p>先定义「认识同侪」：就某个问题而言，两人若拥有相同的相关证据、且推理能力（认识德性）相当，就互为同侪。分歧一旦发生在同侪之间，就格外棘手——你不能用「他没我懂」或「他没看到我的数据」来打发。围绕「该如何回应同侪分歧」，形成两个针锋相对的阵营。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>立场</th>\n<th>主张</th>\n<th>直觉支撑</th>\n<th>软肋</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等权重（conciliationism）</td>\n<td>把同侪意见与自己等同看待，向中间靠拢</td>\n<td>凭什么信自己胜过信同侪？</td>\n<td>自我瓦解、放弃合理坚持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固守（steadfast）</td>\n<td>有权保留原判断，可给自己的推理更高权重</td>\n<td>我毕竟从内部检验过我的理由</td>\n<td>滑向独断、循环自证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>等权重派认为：既然对方与你同样理性知情，你就没有非对称的理由偏袒自己的结论，理性要求你把两个判断平均。固守派反驳：你对自己推理过程的「第一人称」把握是对方没有的证据，据此给自己加权并不违规。这场争论看似是措辞之争，实则触及「更高阶证据（关于自己是否可靠的证据）如何影响一阶信念」这一深层问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用信念度把分歧算出来\">用信念度把分歧算出来</h2><p>形式认识论的贡献是把这些立场写成可计算的更新规则。设你对命题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的信念度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cr_1(H)=0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span>，同侪为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cr_2(H)=0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>，你发现了这个分歧，该更新到多少？</p>\n<p><strong>线性平均（等权重的一种实现）</strong>：取加权平均</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cr_{\\text{new}}(H)=w\\cdot Cr_1(H)+(1-w)\\cdot Cr_2(H),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>等权重取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>——退回两可。<strong>几何平均/对数意见汇集</strong>则对概率取几何平均再归一，在保持某些贝叶斯性质上更优。这些「意见汇集（opinion pooling）」算子各有代价：线性汇集简单但一般不保持独立性、也不与<a href=\"../bayesian/conditionalization\">条件化</a>对易（先汇集再更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ne</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span></span> 先更新再汇集）；几何汇集保 external Bayesianity 但可能过度自信。选哪个汇集算子，本质上是在选「群体理性」的定义，没有中立答案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;同侪分歧: Cr1=0.7, Cr2=0.3&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;如何回应?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;等权重&quot;| C[&quot;线性/几何汇集&lt;br/&gt;向中间靠拢&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;固守&quot;| D[&quot;保留原判&lt;br/&gt;给自己加权&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; E[&quot;奥曼定理背景:&lt;br/&gt;共同先验 + 后验共知 ⇒ 应相等&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;持续分歧 ⇒ 必有前提落空&lt;br/&gt;先验异 / 非同侪 / 信息未公共&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;更新规则可算&lt;br/&gt;但汇集算子不唯一&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[\"同侪分歧: Cr1=0.7, Cr2=0.3\"] --&gt; B{\"如何回应?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"等权重\"| C[\"线性/几何汇集&lt;br/&gt;向中间靠拢\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"固守\"| D[\"保留原判&lt;br/&gt;给自己加权\"]\n  A --&gt; E[\"奥曼定理背景:&lt;br/&gt;共同先验 + 后验共知 ⇒ 应相等\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"持续分歧 ⇒ 必有前提落空&lt;br/&gt;先验异 / 非同侪 / 信息未公共\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"更新规则可算&lt;br/&gt;但汇集算子不唯一\"]\n  D --&gt; G</pre><p>奥曼定理在此提供了理论天花板：若双方真有共同先验、且后验成为共同知识，后验就该相等——这似乎强烈支持等权重。但现实分歧几乎从不满足奥曼的前提（共同先验往往不存在，后验也未必真成共同知识），所以定理不直接裁决规范之争，而是划出了「持续分歧必须由某个前提落空来解释」的边界。这正是把定理与规范讨论衔接的关键：形式结果约束了可能的立场，却不独自决定该采纳哪个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从两人到群体-判断聚合的不可能性\">从两人到群体：判断聚合的不可能性</h2><p>把分歧从两人推广到群体，就进入判断聚合（judgment aggregation）。一个委员会要就多个逻辑相关的命题形成集体判断，如何由个人判断合成？这里潜伏着一个与<a href=\"epistemic-paradoxes\">彩票/序言悖论</a>同源的陷阱——个体理性未必聚合出群体理性。</p>\n<p>经典的「学说悖论（doctrinal paradox）」：三名法官就「被告违约吗（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>）」「合同有效吗（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>）」及结论「须担责吗（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\wedge Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>）」投票。逐命题多数决可能给出：多数认为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、多数认为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，却多数认为不担责——因为不同法官在不同命题上构成多数。个体人人逻辑一致，逐命题多数决的群体判断却违反 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\wedge Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的逻辑约束。List 与 Pettit 把这普遍化为一个不可能定理：没有任何聚合规则能同时满足「普遍定义域、匿名性、系统性、集体理性」——这是判断领域的阿罗定理。它与<a href=\"../../decision-theory-philosophy/foundations/normative-vs-descriptive\">决策论 hub</a>里偏好聚合的阿罗不可能性同构，只是从「想要什么」搬到了「相信什么」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证言-信任与网络结构\">证言、信任与网络结构</h2><p>分歧只是社会认识的一面，另一面是证言——我们绝大多数信念来自他人转告。形式化证言的核心是：听到可靠来源说 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span>，应把它当作确证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 的证据按<a href=\"../bayesian/conditionalization\">条件化</a>更新，权重取决于对来源可靠性的信念度。由此可建模信息在社会网络中的传播，也能量化病态结构：回音室（只接触同质来源，先验被反复自我确认而非被独立证据洗刷，违背<a href=\"../bayesian/problem-of-priors\">先验问题一篇</a>所依赖的独立性）、信息级联（后来者忽略私有信号、盲从可见的前人选择，导致错误集体判断稳定传播）。这些模型近年在算法推荐与社交平台语境下尤其受重视，也把纯理论的社会认识论接到了<a href=\"formal-epistemology-in-practice\">实践与边界一篇</a>所关注的真实系统上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>认识同侪 = 同证据、同能力；同侪分歧无法用「对方更差」打发，逼出等权重 vs 固守之争。</li>\n<li>形式化把两立场写成更新规则：线性/几何意见汇集实现等权重，但汇集算子不唯一、且一般不与条件化对易。</li>\n<li>奥曼定理给出理论天花板（共同先验 + 后验共知 ⇒ 后验相等），但现实分歧不满足其前提，故只划边界不裁决规范。</li>\n<li>判断聚合的学说悖论与 List–Pettit 不可能定理表明个体理性不保证群体理性，是阿罗定理的信念版本。</li>\n<li>证言更新按可靠性加权条件化；回音室与信息级联是可形式化的病态网络结构，接入真实平台研究。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 上游：<a href=\"../dynamics/common-knowledge\">共同知识</a>——奥曼一致性定理是同侪分歧辩论的形式起点。</li>\n<li>本 hub 平行：<a href=\"epistemic-paradoxes\">认识论悖论</a>——「个体理性、群体不理性」的单主体版本。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../epistemology/social-epistemology/echo-chambers\">06_epistemology / 回音室</a>——回音室的概念性社会认识论分析。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"社会认识论与意见分歧：该不该向别人让步","id":"社会认识论与意见分歧-该不该向别人让步"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：认识同侪与两种极端立场","id":"核心概念-认识同侪与两种极端立场"},{"level":2,"text":"用信念度把分歧算出来","id":"用信念度把分歧算出来"},{"level":2,"text":"从两人到群体：判断聚合的不可能性","id":"从两人到群体-判断聚合的不可能性"},{"level":2,"text":"证言、信任与网络结构","id":"证言-信任与网络结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"认识论悖论：彩票、序言与信念度的两难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/practice/epistemic-paradoxes"},"next":{"title":"应用与边界：形式认识论落地到真实系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/practice/formal-epistemology-in-practice"}}